<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Segue initiated as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Segue initiated as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Albany said analyst Damian Rinaldi initiated coverage of Segue Software Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3/8 to 16-5/8.</p>
